# taskforge-api-client — EAV port (apps/taskforge-api-client, semsc v0.1).
#
# The original probes a running TaskForge server over standard.net. Per README
# §27 the network client is DEFERRED (its contract is sigs/standard.net.semsig),
# so this ports the console-observable scaffolding: the startup line and the
# three response section labels the client prints. It JIT-runs and builds to an
# exe today; the net.fetchText flow (and its capability-gated network effect)
# lands with the standard.net runtime. (X-041)

TaskforgeApiClient is project
TaskforgeApiClient module appTaskforgeApiClient
TaskforgeApiClient target console
TaskforgeApiClient entry main

appTaskforgeApiClient is module
appTaskforgeApiClient path apps.taskforgeApiClient
appTaskforgeApiClient exports main
appTaskforgeApiClient purpose "Print the client's console scaffolding (net fetch deferred)"
appTaskforgeApiClient invariant "Writes the startup line and the three response labels in order"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter purpose "Allow controlled writes to standard output"

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main async no
main memory heap no
main purpose "Announce the fetches and print the response section labels"
main invariant "Console scaffolding only; net fetches are deferred"
main let startedText immutable String "started TaskForge fetches before awaiting"
main let healthLabelText immutable String "TaskForge /health response:"
main let versionLabelText immutable String "TaskForge /api/version response:"
main let todosLabelText immutable String "TaskForge /api/todos unauthenticated response:"
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0
main do writeStarted
main do writeHealthLabel
main do writeVersionLabel
main do writeTodosLabel
main return okCode

writeStarted is call
writeStarted in main
writeStarted invokes console.writeLine
writeStarted arg text String startedText

writeHealthLabel is call
writeHealthLabel in main
writeHealthLabel invokes console.writeLine
writeHealthLabel arg text String healthLabelText

writeVersionLabel is call
writeVersionLabel in main
writeVersionLabel invokes console.writeLine
writeVersionLabel arg text String versionLabelText

writeTodosLabel is call
writeTodosLabel in main
writeTodosLabel invokes console.writeLine
writeTodosLabel arg text String todosLabelText
